  "description": "BIBBOG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H116 Dy10 N32 O50 P4. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.814-4.149 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.82-116.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H116Dy10N32O50P4.",
